  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.3.5 (first release of the backend package)\n      - Excel and Word exports and scheduled emails keep outer group layouts, heading styles and table formatting.\n      - Word exports of outer-group reports end with a report total, with a subtotal per group when that option is on.\n      - Clicking the header of a Month/Year column sorts it by date instead of by month name.\n      - Choose Column Label is used in Excel, PDF, Word and CSV exports.\n      - Scheduled Excel exports use each report's saved subtotal settings, matching the browser export.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "6.3.5",
